* [[Omoikane|Omoikane]], the deity of wisdom
* [[Raijin]], the god of lightning, thunder and storms
* [[Ryūjin]], the [[:en:Japanese dragon|Japanese dragon]] god of sea and storms
* [[Sarutahiko Ōkami]], the kami of earth
